---
title: Blog · rails-starter
description: "Notes on running coding agents inside an opinionated Rails monolith: conventions, skills, and changes to the starter."
---
<%= render "layouts/masthead" %>

<main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-5 pt-10 pb-24 sm:px-8 lg:pt-16">
  <header class="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b border-ink/10 pb-10">
    <h1 class="text-section">Blog</h1>
    <p class="max-w-[56ch] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted text-pretty">
      Notes on running coding agents inside an opinionated Rails monolith:
      conventions, skills, and changes to the starter.
    </p>
  </header>

  <% posts = BlogPost.latest %>
  <% if posts.any? %>
    <ul class="flex flex-col">
      <% posts.each do |post| %>
        <li class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-b border-ink/10 py-8">
          <time datetime="<%= post.date %>" class="font-mono text-sm text-riso-deep"><%= post.date.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %></time>
          <a href="<%= post.request_path %>" class="max-w-[32ch] text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance underline decoration-transparent decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:decoration-riso"><%= post.title %></a>
          <% if post.description %>
            <p class="max-w-[58ch] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted text-pretty"><%= post.description %></p>
          <% end %>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
  <% else %>
    <p class="pt-10 font-mono text-sm text-ink-muted">Nothing here yet.</p>
  <% end %>

  <footer class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4 pt-6 font-mono text-xs text-ink-muted">
    <a href="/" class="underline decoration-[1.5px] underline-offset-4 hover:text-riso-deep">&larr; rails-starter</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/thecodingend/rails-starter" aria-label="GitHub repository, 5 stars" class="underline decoration-[1.5px] underline-offset-4 hover:text-riso-deep">github <span class="text-riso-deep" aria-hidden="true">★</span> 5</a>
  </footer>
</main>
